  "issues": [
    "Grounding: The quoted weighted mean values (e.g., Adelie 190.268670) do not appear in any printed output; the weighted‑mean code failed with a SyntaxError, so no such results were produced.",
    "Methodological error: The weighting scheme uses total penguin counts per island rather than the number of penguins of the given species on each island, which biases the species means.",
    "Missing data: Two rows have null flipper_length_mm values, but the analysis does not mention how these were handled.",
    "Unnecessary complexity: The estimand requires the overall mean flipper length per species, which can be computed directly without island weighting; the answer does not provide that straightforward calculation."
